  "translation": "Mme Elisha a tlhoma mo ntlong ya gagwe, mme bagodi ba tlhoma ⟨את⟩ le ene; mme a romela monna kwa pele ga gagwe; mme pele ga morongwa a ka tsena go ene, ene a re go bagodi: A lo bone fa morwa wa mobolaisi yo o rometswe go ntsha ⟨את⟩ tlhogo ya me? Lebelang, fa morongwa a tsena, bolang lebati, mme lo mo gatelele ⟨את⟩ ka lebati; a ga go modumo wa dinao tsa mong wa gagwe kwa morago ga gagwe?",
